{"unit_id":"pepsi-ai__dsh-session-delete#feature-1","repo":"pepsi-ai/dsh-session-delete","commit":"5aa24c7ac6c44a257a04f09375e48234012c6b00","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 的功能「界面删除会话」：在当前会话标题栏提供垃圾桶按钮，侧栏会话行菜单提供删除入口。点击后打开确认对话框，需勾选确认后才能提交删除。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:377-420","src/client.js:443-449","src/client.js:472-502"]}
{"unit_id":"pepsi-ai__dsh-session-delete#feature-2","repo":"pepsi-ai/dsh-session-delete","commit":"5aa24c7ac6c44a257a04f09375e48234012c6b00","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 的功能「清理会话数据」：确认删除后移除会话日志目录、投影缓存记录及工作区和归档会话记账，检查日志目录已清除后才处理工作区记账。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:233-268"]}
{"unit_id":"pepsi-ai__dsh-session-delete#feature-3","repo":"pepsi-ai/dsh-session-delete","commit":"5aa24c7ac6c44a257a04f09375e48234012c6b00","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 的功能「删除运行中的会话」：删除运行中的会话时先取消 agent 当前任务并等待其空闲，随后刷新会话状态并移除会话数据；界面会显示运行状态提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:162-181","src/index.js:233-268","src/client.js:370-375"]}
