{"unit_id":"pepsi-ai__dsh-session-delete#feature-5","repo":"pepsi-ai/dsh-session-delete","commit":"5aa24c7ac6c44a257a04f09375e48234012c6b00","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 的功能「删除后刷新列表」：界面删除成功后刷新侧栏会话列表；如果刚删除的是当前会话，则打开列表中的下一条会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:335-360"]}
